ue across different dates, I'll use this figure to calculate the absolute difference between the two issue dates.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_81a77521017f479180f361f8","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"todo__todo_write","arguments":{"content":"- [x] Find treasury bill data for October 3, 1952 and December 18, 1952\n- [x] Get total outstanding amounts (nominal) in million dollars\n- [x] Calculate absolute difference\n- [x] Round to nearest whole number\n- [x] Write answer to /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
